about a gathering.

00:23:57.730 --> 00:24:00.250
Yes, it was all sudden.

00:24:00.250 --> 00:24:01.470
Every last bit of it.

00:24:01.890 --> 00:24:10.980
Chapter 10
Parting

00:24:01.990 --> 00:24:03.880
Next time on Rozen Maiden...

00:24:04.390 --> 00:24:07.030
Swear upon this rose ring.
